{"3279760": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Time Forgotten", "steam_appid": 3279760, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279760/extras/c4a46510f886ae1bc4941468de5c6f94.avif?t=1780884785\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279760/extras_big/c4a46510f886ae1bc4941468de5c6f94.webp?t=1780884785 width=1560 height=658 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><u>Creation</u></strong><br>Before you hop into a game you must select your dinosaur, which you will customize to your liking. <br>Each dinosaur begins with <strong>3 core abilities</strong> and then throughout the match, you will advance your evolutionary traits by gaining Evolution Points. These are found through Evolution Spires littered through the map or by eliminating other players.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279760/extras/a9334d04bcaca38cf80d09b849623515.avif?t=1780884785\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279760/extras_big/a9334d04bcaca38cf80d09b849623515.webp?t=1780884785 width=1560 height=639 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><u><strong>The Battle For Dominance</strong></u><br>You may find trails of other opponents, you will use these to track down and fight other dinosaurs. Every battle is extremely unforgiving so be careful with how you ambush your targets. One wrong move and you may find yourself <strong>extinct.</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279760/extras/9b94c32e17662d44997e14ab88b1c4a6.avif?t=1780884785\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279760/extras_big/9b94c32e17662d44997e14ab88b1c4a6.avif?t=1780884785 width=800 height=334 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><u><strong>Exploration</strong></u><br>The Island is your hunting ground, get to know it well. <br>The Island is home to many biomes, from arid badlands to lush spruce forests, to underground labyrinths like the Biolume Caverns.  <br>Find notes and other clues around human structures to help unravel an ever changing story. <br>Explore carefully, as the match nears its end, a ring of flames known as <strong>The Firestorm</strong> will put you on the move.<br>Matches are anything but short, <strong>so make every choice carefully</strong>.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279760/extras/188472c8db7b0df193344d662eb0a453.avif?t=1780884785\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279760/extras_big/188472c8db7b0df193344d662eb0a453.webp?t=1780884785 width=1560 height=759 /></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><u><strong>Progression </strong></u><br>Every match will provide rewards, experience and rank will be rewarded based on performance.  <br>Leveling up your dinosaur will grant you new colors and customizations. Letting you make it truly yours. <br> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><u><strong>A True Test Of Survival </strong></u><br><strong>The Time Forgotten</strong> is a hardcore Battle Royale set on a massive forgotten Island, where YOU play as a Dinosaur. Discover the story and fight for survival against other players in a brutal struggle for victory. The ecosystem is actively working against you in your fight for survival so be cautious as other dinosaurs are not your only worry on this forsaken island.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279760/extras/c4a46510f886ae1bc4941468de5c6f94.avif?t=1780884785\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279760/extras_big/c4a46510f886ae1bc4941468de5c6f94.webp?t=1780884785 width=1560 height=658 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><u>Creation</u></strong><br>Before you hop into a game you must select your dinosaur, which you will customize to your liking. <br>Each dinosaur begins with <strong>3 core abilities</strong> and then throughout the match, you will advance your evolutionary traits by gaining Evolution Points. These are found through Evolution Spires littered through the map or by eliminating other players.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279760/extras/a9334d04bcaca38cf80d09b849623515.avif?t=1780884785\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279760/extras_big/a9334d04bcaca38cf80d09b849623515.webp?t=1780884785 width=1560 height=639 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><u><strong>The Battle For Dominance</strong></u><br>You may find trails of other opponents, you will use these to track down and fight other dinosaurs. Every battle is extremely unforgiving so be careful with how you ambush your targets. One wrong move and you may find yourself <strong>extinct.</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279760/extras/9b94c32e17662d44997e14ab88b1c4a6.avif?t=1780884785\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/ap